<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Guidance Webinar</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
        .logo { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
    </style>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  td { padding: 5px 0; }
</style>
<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial;
  }
  ul {
    list-style-type: disc;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: right;">
        <div class="logo">Sea Grant<br>New York</div>
    </div>
    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 36pt; margin-top: 100px;">2019 MCD Small Grants Administrative Guidance Webinar</h1>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
        <p>
            <span data-field="presenter.name">{{ presenter.name }}</span>, <span data-field="presenter.title">{{ presenter.title }}</span><br>
            <span data-field="presenter.organization">{{ presenter.organization }}</span><br>
            Wednesday <span data-field="event_date">{{ event_date }}</span><br>
            <span data-field="event_time">{{ event_time }}</span> EST
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 50px;">
            A Joint Program of • <span data-field="partner1">{{ partner1 }}</span> • <span data-field="partner2">{{ partner2 }}</span> • <span data-field="partner3">{{ partner3 }}</span>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 24pt;">Agenda</h2>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>Welcome & Introductions</li>
        <li>Purpose: Convey guidance to ensure successful completion of award agreement, and reduce potential liable</li>
        <li>Administrative Reporting
            <ul style="list-style-type: circle; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li>Financial Disclosure</li>
                <li>Technical Narrative</li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li>Best Management Practices (BMPs)
            <ul style="list-style-type: circle; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li>Photography Policy</li>
                <li>Acknowledgement Funding Source</li>
                <li>Social Media</li>
                <li>Site Visit</li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li>Other</li>
    </ul>
    <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 10pt;">2</div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: right;">
        <div class="logo">Sea Grant<br>New York</div>
    </div>
    <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-top: 50px;">Instructions for asking questions during this webinar</h2>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>Use the majority of the time to present the information</li>
        <li>All participants are muted</li>
        <li>Questions will be taken at the end of this presentation</li>
        <li>Participants who joined by computer must use the <span data-field="chat_feature">{{ chat_feature }}</span> feature, and NYSG will take these questions</li>
    </ul>
    <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 10pt;">3</div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: right;">
        <div class="logo">Sea Grant<br>New York</div>
    </div>
    <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-top: 50px;">Instructions for asking questions during this webinar</h2>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>Participants who joined by telephone must email their questions to <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span> to receive answers after the webinar</li>
        <li>FAQ list and the presentation slides will be available on the website, in seven business days.</li>
    </ul>
    <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 10pt;">4</div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: right;">
        <div class="logo">Sea Grant<br>New York</div>
    </div>
    <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-top: 50px;">Administrative Reporting</h2>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>Pre-established dates
            <ul style="list-style-type: circle; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li><span data-field="date1">{{ date1 }}</span></li>
                <li><span data-field="date2">{{ date2 }}</span></li>
                <li>NYSG sends notice/reminder package 4-6 weeks before due date</li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li>Reporting requirements
            <ul style="list-style-type: circle; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li>Two Tier Report
                    <ul style="list-style-type: circle; padding-left: 20px;">
                        <li>Part 1: Financial Disclosure (request payment for Cost Reimbursable Award/CRA)</li>
                        <li>Part 2: Technical Narrative (document accomplishments)</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li>NYSG must approve <span data-field="approval_type">{{ approval_type }}</span> (contact <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span>)</li>
            </ul>
        </li>
    </ul>
    <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 10pt;">5</div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: right;">
        <div class="logo">Sea Grant<br>New York</div>
    </div>
    <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-top: 50px;">Part 1: Financial Disclosure</h2>
    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px;">
        <thead>
            <tr style="background-color: #f0f0f0;">
                <th style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: left;">Send to:</th>
                <th style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: left;">Office of Sponsored Programs</th>
                <th style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: left;">Invoice for New York Sea Grant Project</th>
                <th style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: left;">Date</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">Organization:</td>
                <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><span data-field="org_name">{{ org_name }}</span></td>
                <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">NYSG Project #:</td>
                <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><span data-field="invoice_date">{{ invoice_date }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">Address:</td>
                <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><span data-field="org_address">{{ org_address }}</span></td>
                <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">PO or account #:</td>
                <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><span data-field="po_account">{{ po_account }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">From:</td>
                <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">Vendor contact information</td>
                <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">Project Period:</td>
                <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><span data-field="project_period">{{ project_period }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
        <div style="width: 45%;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">ANALYSIS OF CURRENT AND CUMULATIVE EXPENDITURES</h3>
            <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px;">
                <thead>
                    <tr style="background-color: #f0f0f0;">
                        <th style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: left;">Budget Category</th>
                        <th style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: right;">Budget amount</th>
                        <th style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: right;">Expenditures Current Period</th>
                        <th style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: right;">Total to Date</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for category in budget_categories %}
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{{ category.description }}</td>
                        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: right;">{{ category.budget_amount }}</td>
                        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: right;">{{ category.current_expenditure }}</td>
                        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: right;">{{ category.total_expenditure }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">Total Costs</td>
                        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: right;">{{ total_costs.budget }}</td>
                        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: right;">{{ total_costs.current }}</td>
                        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: right;">{{ total_costs.total }}</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
            <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 9pt;">
                I hereby certify that to the best of my knowledge the expenses herein contained on this invoice and for which compensation is requested are for services actually performed and costs incurred pursuant to the terms of the agreement, and that no payment or reimbursement of expenses has heretofore been requested or received by me or any other party. I further certify that the documentation concerning this claim is on file and will be made available for audit purposes to the Research Foundation or any other person authorized by the Research Foundation, including state and federal auditors.
            </p>
            <p style="margin-top: 40px;">Signature of Fiscal Designer</p>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 50%; padding-left: 50px;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">BMPs for using this form</h3>
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li>Due 4/30/2020 and 10/30/2020 (i.e. twice)</li>
                <li>Invoice form (Excel)</li>
                <li>Write information for your organization in the “Vendor contact information” section</li>
                <li>Budget categories and amount match Form 90-4 project budget</li>
                <li>10 percent rule, allowed to change category amounts no more than 10% total budget, excess requires NYSG/MCD Board approval (AVOID)</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: right;">
        <div class="logo">Sea Grant<br>New York</div>
    </div>
    <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-top: 50px;">Financial Disclosure cont'd</h2>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>Check your math</li>
        <li>Email financial disclosure to <span data-field="email_recipient">{{ email_recipient }}</span> and cc <span data-field="cc_recipient">{{ cc_recipient }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="note_on_address">{{ note_on_address }}</span></li>
        <li>Do not submit cancelled checks or receipts for expenses, keep records for 6 months as back-up</li>
        <li>Out-of-cycle (OOC) is any request that is beyond the administrative reporting periods
            <ul style="list-style-type: circle; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li>Contact <span data-field="ooc_contact">{{ ooc_contact }}</span> for pre-approval</li>
            </ul>
        </li>
    </ul>
    <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 10pt;">7</div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: right;">
        <div class="logo">Sea Grant<br>New York</div>
    </div>
    <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-top: 50px;">Award Term Date</h2>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li><span data-field="grant_office_established">{{ grant_office_established }}</span> in contract agreement (Item # 3)</li>
        <li>NYSG acknowledges this date is unrealistic for most awardees (Sep 2019 start date)</li>
        <li>NYSG is working with the grants office to resolve this issue, and will send instructions to Project Leaders</li>
        <li>Financial Disclosure reporting dates may be subject to change after outcome of grants office meeting</li>
    </ul>
    <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 10pt;">8</div>
</div>




<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 28pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Part 2: Technical Narrative</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Submitted to <span data-field="recipient_name">{{ recipient_name }}</span> (<span data-field="recipient_email">{{ recipient_email }}</span>)</p>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">cc'd to <span data-field="cc_name">{{ cc_name }}</span> (<span data-field="cc_email">{{ cc_email }}</span>)</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Sea Grant Logo" style="width: 150px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 5px;">NYSG Small Grants Program Report</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">MS Word template (dual purpose)</h3>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px;">
      <li>Interim Progress Report</li>
      <li>Completion Report</li>
      <li>NYSG sends notice 4-6 weeks before due</li>
      <li>Report on progress to achieve objectives in grant application</li>
      <li>Projects completed within 6 months must submit with Financial Disclosure</li>
      <li>Completion Report (4/30/2020)</li>
      <li>Project Summary (4/30/2020)</li>
      <li>Projects extend beyond 6 months should submit with Financial Disclosure</li>
      <li>Interim Progress Report (4/30/2020)</li>
      <li>Completion Report (10/30/2020)</li>
      <li>Project Summary (10/30/2020)</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 28pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Technical Narrative cont'd</h1>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px;">
        <li>Pictorial</li>
        <li>Separate file attachment</li>
        <li>Use space to write credit and caption for picture files</li>
        <li>Photography BMP (below)</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">Use this form to document as much information as possible (<span data-field="length_note">{{ length_note }}</span>)</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Sea Grant Logo" style="width: 150px;">
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 28pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Project Summary</h1>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 20px;">About this document</h2>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px;">
        <li>Used to report project results and outcome to the MCD Board</li>
        <li>Submit with Completion Report</li>
        <li>Interactive (fillable) PDF document</li>
        <li>Use mouse over feature to display tips for each field</li>
        <li>Preset word limit for each section</li>
      </ul>
      <ol style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <li>Project Title</li>
        <li>Write one sentence that speaks to the values and priorities that best represents this work.</li>
        <li>Why was this project or work necessary?</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">Instructions</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">This form must be submitted with your Completion Report. New York Sea Grant will use this information for reporting to the NYS DOE and the Marine and Coastal District Research Grants Program. The form contains tips to help you to write the narrative, which is visible by hovering the cursor over the field. Please read all instructions carefully before filling out this form.</p>
        <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
          <tr>
            <td style="width: 20%;">Project Leader or PI</td>
            <td><span data-field="project_leader_name">{{ project_leader_name }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Institution or Organization</td>
            <td><span data-field="institution_name">{{ institution_name }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Address (Street, City, Zip)</td>
            <td><span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Telephone</td>
            <td><span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Email</td>
            <td><span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Co-Project Leader or Co-PI</td>
            <td><span data-field="co_leader_name">{{ co_leader_name }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Institution or Organization</td>
            <td><span data-field="co_institution_name">{{ co_institution_name }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Address (Street, City, Zip)</td>
            <td><span data-field="co_address">{{ co_address }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Telephone</td>
            <td><span data-field="co_phone">{{ co_phone }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Email</td>
            <td><span data-field="co_email">{{ co_email }}</span></td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
          <p>1. Project Title</p>
          <div style="height: 50px; border: 1px solid #ccc;"></div>
          <p>2. Write one sentence that speaks to the values and priorities that best represents this work.</p>
          <div style="height: 80px; border: 1px solid #ccc;"></div>
          <p>3. Why was this project or work necessary?</p>
          <div style="height: 100px; border: 1px solid #ccc;"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">Project Summary cont'd</h2>
      <ol style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <li>What happened as a result of this project or work?</li>
        <li>Stakeholder Summary</li>
        <li>Partners - Use the space provided to list relevant project partners, identify co-funders, if applicable.</li>
        <li>Performance Measures</li>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Include measurable impacts i.e., quantitative data, answerable questions. When this is not possible, describe the expected impact in qualitative terms. Be specific about the expected impact. Be specific about the expected impact. Be specific about the expected impact.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">a) Qualitative Performance Measurements</p>
        <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 10%;">Select all applicable</td>
              <td style="width: 40%;">Description</td>
              <td style="width: 50%;">Measurement</td>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
              <td>Number of stakeholders or beneficiaries modifying their practices as a result of this project. (This must be evaluated through a survey or other method)</td>
              <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
              <td>Number of people, including teachers/students, educated on critical environmental issues.</td>
              <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
              <td>Number of products or materials created. Please include specific details (e.g., fact sheets, websites, social media posts, pdfs, etc.).</td>
              <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
              <td>Number of businesses retained or created.</td>
              <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
              <td>Number of community benefits in dollars.</td>
              <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
              <td>Number of job creation/retention/displacement/businesses using info/techniques presented in the project.</td>
              <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
              <td>Increase in, or use of, hazard resiliency preparedness learned through the project.</td>
              <td></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">b) Qualitative Performance Measurements</p>
        <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 20%;">Name</td>
              <td style="width: 40%;">Organization/Affiliation</td>
              <td style="width: 40%;">Quote, Testimony, Comment, etc.</td>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <!-- Loop for qualitative measurements -->
            {% for i in range(3) %}
            <tr>
              <td><span data-field="qualitative_measurements[{{ i }}].name">{{ 'Name' }}</span></td>
              <td><span data-field="qualitative_measurements[{{ i }}].organization">{{ 'Organization' }}</span></td>
              <td><span data-field="qualitative_measurements[{{ i }}].quote">{{ 'Quote' }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">Performance Measurements</h2>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px;">
        <li>Used to record project results as</li>
        <li>Quantitative</li>
        <li>Qualitative</li>
        <li>NYSG/MCD values both types</li>
      </ul>
      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px;">Quantitative Performance Measurements</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Values that we count and measure e.g., # participants, economic activity</p>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Don't feel bad if you are unable to check multiple (or any) boxes</p>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Be prepared to verify this claim e.g., Facebook likes, registry, downloads</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">Project Summary cont'd</h2>
      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px;">Pictorial</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Provide any images/photographs of personnel at work, participating in the activity, in the field or related to the project. Images should be high resolution (300 dpi at 4x6 or larger). Each image must have a caption and credit. Images must be submitted in BMP format.</p>
      <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <td style="width: 20%;">File Name (jpg format)</td>
            <td style="width: 30%;">Photographer/Owner</td>
            <td style="width: 20%;">Date</td>
            <td style="width: 30%;">Caption</td>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <!-- Loop for pictorials -->
          {% for i in range(3) %}
          <tr>
